Playback stack — required attribution
================================================================================

ExoPlayer / AndroidX Media3
---------------------------
SlugYard’s primary (Exo) playback path is built on AndroidX Media3 / ExoPlayer
(Apache License 2.0), including a project fork of selected Media3 modules.

- Upstream: https://github.com/androidx/media
- Project notes: app/libs/README.md and playflix-media3-mods/README.md

Copyright of the original Media3 / ExoPlayer code remains with Google LLC and
Android Open Source Project contributors, as stated in upstream notices.

mpv / libmpv
------------
SlugYard’s MPV playback path uses libmpv (and related mpv-android packaging).
mpv and libmpv are free software; see their respective licenses (typically GPL
with LGPL/GPL FFmpeg components depending on build).

- mpv: https://mpv.io/ / https://github.com/mpv-player/mpv
- libmpv-android packaging used by this project:
  https://github.com/jarnedemeulemeester/libmpv-android

Kodi-derived FFmpeg audio downmix
---------------------------------
The FFmpeg decoder / downmix path under `ffmpeg-decoder-downmix/` is based on
the AndroidX Media3 `decoder_ffmpeg` extension (Apache-2.0), with additional
downmix behavior adapted from Kodi (`xbmc/xbmc`, GPL-2.0-or-later):

- center mix defaults and metadata offsets
- explicit output channel layout selection for downmix
- downmix normalization behavior

Reference: xbmc/cores/AudioEngine/Engines/ActiveAE/ActiveAEResampleFFMPEG.cpp
Snapshot:
https://github.com/xbmc/xbmc/blob/9746df6d7de2503047417099e2dcd8ec5276db40/xbmc/cores/AudioEngine/Engines/ActiveAE/ActiveAEResampleFFMPEG.cpp

Full module notice: ffmpeg-decoder-downmix/NOTICE.md

